msgctxt "308"
msgid "Hehehe. So I don't know if I ever mentioned it, but I love to sing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I'll do \"Where Has Your Touch Gone?\" This song is just so, so good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Sounds great. It's all yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "How are we doing in the rankings?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Huh!? Where are you going? Kiryu-san, aren't we gonna sing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"Hehe. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Pretty sure that's the best I've ever done "
"in, like, ever. I don't think I could have done so great without you "
"cheering me on, though, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"Oh, oh! I wanna hear you sing something, Kiryu-san! "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "I'll sing \"Kamurocho Lullaby,\" then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's enka, isn't it? Kiryu-san, that's so cool! I'm looking forward "
"to hearing you sing. ♪"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid "Nah, not right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Aww, are you sure? I was really hoping I'd get to hear you sing..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid ""
"Wow, I don't know what was wrong with me. I was having a super hard time "
"singing that..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"Wow, Kiryu-san! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'm amazed at how good you are! I "
"was totally into it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "Really? Thanks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "Umm... Well, how well you sang doesn't matter as long as you had fun! Right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "Sorry, my throat's just a little sore today..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
